      "marks": [
       {
        "type": "bold"
       }
      ],
      "text": "⍉red flags:"
     },
     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": " many pts need ⍉testing; diagnose from Hx and exam and start tx."
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "type": "paragraph",
    "attrs": {
     "indLeft": 18,
     "indRight": 0,
     "indFirst": -18,
     "spaceBefore": 0,
     "spaceAfter": 0,
     "line": null,
     "align": "left",
     "shade": null,
     "borders": null,
     "marker": {
      "text": "•",
      "font": null,
      "marks": [],
      "tabPt": 18
     }
    },
    "content": [
     {
      "type": "text",
      "marks": [
       {
        "type": "bold"
       }
      ],
      "text": "Chronic cough ⍉helped by presumptive tx:"
     },
     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": " CXR; if it = norm, test in turn for asthma (PFTs, methacholine challenge if spirometry = norm), sinus dz (sinus CT) and GERD (esophageal pH monitoring)."
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "type": "paragraph",
    "attrs": {
     "indLeft": 18,
     "indRight": 0,
     "indFirst": -18,
     "spaceBefore": 0,
     "spaceAfter": 0,
     "line": null,
     "align": "left",
     "shade": null,
     "borders": null,
     "marker": {
      "text": "•",
